# Outfit body (R18): a rain poncho draped from the shoulders: full width from the shoulders down (it hides the arms the
# way a real poncho does), a short slope only up to the neck, a ragged stepped hem, accent hem band and front stripe,
# one glow stripe. Torso inside x 3..9, y 3..11 (pivot 6 7 0 on spine_03).
name outfit_poncho
grid 5
size 12 14 12
slot cloth SwatchMain
slot hem SwatchAccent
slot glow SwatchGlow
box 0 0 1 12 14 10 cloth
box 1 0 0 11 14 1 cloth
box 1 1 10 11 13 11 cloth
box 2 3 11 10 11 12 cloth
carve box 0 0 1 1 1 10
carve box 11 0 1 12 1 10
carve box 0 13 1 1 14 10
carve box 11 13 1 12 14 10
carve box 3 3 0 9 11 11
carve box 4 5 11 8 9 12
carve box 1 0 0 3 2 1
carve box 9 12 0 11 14 1
paint box 0 0 0 12 14 2 hem
paint box 5.5 0 0 6.5 14 12 hem
paint box 0 0 6 12 14 7 glow
pivot 6 7 0
